meta {
  name: Upload env card
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me/envcard
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  envcard: @file()
}

docs {
  User login (cookie Authentication_User): run "User auth / Login" first. The user must also be approved (is_validate), or this answers 403. A PDF of at most 10 MB; no file is 400 "envcard is required". A second copy is 400 "user already has file(s)", except at status 12 of a request for a new card (Request Type 2-11), where the copy replaces the Old card's.
}
